fix(audit-RC1): normalize dot-segments + canonical prefix guard in path resolution

All File(base, userPath) joins in resolveSessionHostPath and
resolveHostPath now go through safeResolveWithin():
1. Dot-segment normalization (RFC 3986) - traversal that climbs
   above base is rejected (returns null).
2. canonicalFile startsWith prefix guard - detects symlink-based
   escape even when dot-segments are clean.

Covers all 4 entry points (browser intercept, ChatLinkResolver,
WebAppPathResolver, DeepLink OpenHtmlPreview) via the two
existing functions.

Also adds a pure-function normalizeDotSegments() at top level
(zero Android deps) with 10 JVM unit tests.
